# fin1_g2_eta1_mn with eta 0.01 and the no-adhesion contact off (CONTACT_NO_TENSION 0): hypothesis: the weaker viscosity keeps the rods as clump-free as eta 0.1 only if the contact does not release pairs early, and without CONTACT_NO_TENSION the bodies close the gap in the middle (user 10-03)
EXPLICIT_VOL_SPH_DIVV 1
STRESS_2D_GIZMO 1
RIEMANN_PSTAR_FLOOR 1
STRESS_RATE_RAW_GRAD 1
HLLC_WAVESPEED_GIZMO 1
CONTACT_NO_TENSION 0
TENSILE_CORRECTION_LOCAL 0
TENSILE_CORRECTION_POWER 4.
TC_TOTAL_STRESS_GATE 2
@sml tol 1e-10
TENSILE_CORRECTION_PREFAC 0.3
SLOPE_LIMITER_EPS 1e-10
RECON_FACE_DV 7
RECON_FACE_DV6_S0 5e-3
RECON_FACE_DV7_S0T 8e-3
NL_SWITCH_TC 1
NL_SWITCH_DIVV 1
NL_SWITCH_FACE 1
NL_SWITCH_TAU 2.
GNOG_PENALTY 2
MATERIAL_VISCOSITY 1
VISC_MOMENT_NORM 1
@mat eta 0.01
@mat eta 0.01 W4p W4s
